LRC n=4 additive-return formula (codex-S553)
Family: primitive generator pairs (a,b), speeds (a,b,a+b), threshold 1/4

Closed form
  a,b odd and a+b=0 mod 4: M=(ab-1)/(16ab)
  a,b odd and a+b=2 mod 4: M=(ab+3)/(16ab)
  one even generator e, odd generator o, c=a+b, e=0 mod 4: M=(oc+1)/(16oc)
  one even generator e, odd generator o, c=a+b, e=2 mod 4: M=(oc-3)/(16oc)

